WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:04.670
(SINGING) Oh, oh, oh my goodness.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.290
Oh my word.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:12.550
Gracious me, what is this genius we all have just heard?

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.880
It gave me the chills.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.150
It gave me the feels.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:19.860
It made me both weep and kick up my heels

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:25.490
'cause you are the music.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.410
You are the pulse and the pitch and the time

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:30.340
and the tune and the groove.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.800
And look at you move.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.280
You are the music.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.960
If your song were a painting, I would

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.930
think it should be hung in the Louvre.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.360
You are the music.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.950
You are the music.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.260
Now, wait a second.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.530
Buddy, look at you.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:57.850
You've got skills I'm playing second fiddle to.

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:00.390
I cry when you croon, I sing when you strum,

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:05.160
and what's that cool fingering you did with your thumb?

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:10.800
Yeah, you are the music.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.290
You've got a knack for the notes and a tantalizing

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.520
touch with a tune.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.310
You got me over the moon.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:21.640
You are the music.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:26.470
Roll over, Beethoven, Mick Jagger, and Miss Debby Boone.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:29.300
You are the music.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:32.216
You are the music.

00:01:32.216 --> 00:01:33.580
You are awesome.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.690
You are awesomer.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.480
Your music flies to me on wings of gossamer.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.800
You're iconic.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.450
You're, like, bionic.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.985
You'll be my dominant, I'll be your tonic.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.380
We are the music.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.880
We'd like to learn music.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.560
We bring the lightning, the fire, the water, the earth,

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.420
and the air.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:57.300
There's no getting through.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.135
We are the music.

00:02:00.135 --> 00:02:01.645
Will we learn some music?

00:02:01.645 --> 00:02:05.620
We're Billy Joel, Yo-Yo Ma, 50 Cent, Chubby Checker, and Cher.

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:06.640
Now what'll we do?

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.199
We are the music.

00:02:08.199 --> 00:02:09.250
Forte.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.570
We are the music.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:12.060
Piano.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:14.180
We are the music.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:16.760
(QUIETLY) Pianissimo.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.120
Where did the children go?

